  "review_notes": [
    "The accepted alignment gave the *the* of *all the host of heaven* to the construct צְבָא and marked the rectum's article unrepresented. Rule 29's fronting paragraph is explicit that where the rectum carries an article and is rendered anarthrously, that morpheme takes the *the* even though English fronts it to the phrase's left edge; a supplied *the* on the construct is licensed only where no article morpheme is present or where a second *the* is written. Only one *the* is written here.",
    "Variant unit WLC.2KI.17.16.v002 is underdetermined and resolved to r00-base in the projection; no new textual decision was made (rule 9).",
    "The article before Baal stays unrepresented: there the ASV writes no *the* for the phrase at all."
  ]
